.sp
.if n \{\
.RS 4
.\}
.nf
# nvme feat power\-mgmt /dev/nvme0
.fi
.if n \{\
.RE
.\}
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.sp -1
.IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
Has the program issue a feat power\-mgmt to set power state and workload hint:
.sp
.if n \{\
.RS 4
.\}
.nf
# nvme feat power\-mgmt /dev/nvme0 \-\-ps=1 \-\-wh=2 \-\-save
.fi
.if n \{\
.RE
.\}
.RE
